	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Incredibile dictu est, venerande in Christo pater, quantum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>me res haec una excrutiet, ut tibi satisfaciam; sed <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nihil efficio nec scio, quae spes ex me cessantibus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>illis, qui cum tibi tum mihi suum officium sunt <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>polliciti.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Scis d. <persName>Iulium</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8358">Gadium</persName>, <persName ref="p8114">Balingketum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p6831">Traversium</persName>, <persName>Fridericum</persName> hanc curam ad se recepisse; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sed nihildum praestiterunt.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Rogo te vehementer, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ut hanc excusationem meam boni consulas; sed <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non desinam facere, quod possum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Adolescentem, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quem mihi commendasti quemque et literis, qua <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>potui diligentia, iuvi, precibus enixe obtestatus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sum, ut in hanc curam incumbat; sedulo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>promisit operam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nos ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> nihil audimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/><persName>Pellizarii</persName>, mercatores primarii, hic substiterunt; <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>illi ne verbum quidem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Consul noster <persName ref="p3196">Tscharnerus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l473">S. Gallo</placeName> et <placeName ref="l2582">Feldkircho</placeName> ne verbum de concilio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Quare, cum nihil habeam, tibi scriptione mea <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>non essem molestus, nisi sic saltem aliqua <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ex parte tibi diligentiam meam probare satagerem.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>De tua diligentia, mi pater, nunquam, quod sciam, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>conquestus sum, quod tu videris in tuis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>timere; esset id facinus impudens; imo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>me pudet, quod tibi molestus esse non desino, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>quem quibus remunerer, non habeo.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Si quando <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>de mea sorte conqueror, id non ita accipias, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>quasi te in culpae partem accersam.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Scribis de d. <persName ref="p629">Coignetio</persName>, quod <placeName ref="l760">Solothuro</placeName> ad te <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>literas scripserit, quod miror, cum certo apud <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nos fertur eum minime tutum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Consul <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>noster <placeName ref="l473">S. Galli</placeName> literas vidit, quas <persName ref="p8354">Frölichius</persName> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>superiori mense ad <persName ref="p8108">Tschudium</persName> quendam, praefectum in <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName>Liechtensteig</placeName>, scripsit; in illis gloriatur multum, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>quantam in invidiam verbis apud <persName>Guisium</persName> d. <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><persName ref="p629">Coignetium</persName> induxerit, <persName>Guisiumque</persName> dixisse <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>sibi de <persName ref="p629">Coignetii</persName> perfidia constare operamque daturum <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ut meritas luat poenas.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quare valde timeo, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ne nimis sit credulus et in illos suos hostes <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>incidat etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Attulerat idem consul laetum admodum nuncium, quod ex <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>consule <placeName ref="l473">S. Gallensi</placeName>, affine suo, acceperat quodque <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><placeName ref="l15">Antverpia</placeName> per postam dicebatur Isenacum nunciatum, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>inde ad <placeName ref="l473">S. Gallensem</placeName> senatum per idem tempus <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>scriptum, cum consul ibi haeret: <persName>Rogendorffium</persName> cum suis <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>a <persName>Guisio</persName> defecisse et ex pacto et convento cum <lb xml:id="p2z15"/><placeName ref="l367">Aurelianis</placeName> praesidiariis in <persName>Guisianos</persName>, qui obsidionem <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>parabant, impetum fecisse exque illis 5000 confecisse.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Longę sunt ambages per omnes circumstantias, <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>ut, si fictum est, habuerit satis ingeniosum magi<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>strum; sed postquam vos nihil, non credimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Fictum est etc.; <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>sed <placeName ref="l473">S. Gallenses</placeName> omnino crediderunt.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Iam sub noctem prodeo et video rediisse <lb xml:id="p2z22"/><placeName ref="l306">Mediolano</placeName> <persName ref="p4788">Finerum</persName>, veterem praefectum, <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>qui iam redierat, substitit autem <placeName ref="l306">Mediolani</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>fere per integrum mensem.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Quem cum salute <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>et de statu <placeName ref="l834">Italię</placeName> prolixe quęro (nam soli <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>eramus), dicit hoc certum compertumque esse: <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>pontificem versari <placeName ref="l425">Romae</placeName> in magno <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>discrimine; ita se ex magnatibus illius <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>loci intellexisse.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Der baapst sye in großen sorgen <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>und großer uneinigkeit mit dem hertzogen <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>von Ferrär; so sye man ouch zuͦ <placeName ref="l306">Meyland</placeName> ab der <pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/><placeName ref="l830">Engellender</placeName> zuͦkunfft in <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> treffenlich <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>übel erschrocken.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Es habe im ouch der probst, so <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>lettslich bottschafft wyß in unseren <placeName ref="l648">Pündten</placeName> <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>gesyn, geklagt (dan sy hand in für ein bäpstler; <lb xml:id="p3z5"/><foreign xml:lang="la">sed est generis neutri);</foreign> er fürchte, das, so die iren <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>in <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> verlierind, sich aller krieg in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>ziechen werde.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Sonst ist es träffenlich thür in <lb xml:id="p3z8"/><placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>, alles uff dem väld verbrunnen; man <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>achte, das es innert 50 jaaren so thür nit gesyn.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z10"/>Von dem concilio weist er nütt, dan das die <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>da dannen kommend, sagend, wie es so <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>gottssäliglich und ordenlich zuͦgang und <lb xml:id="p3z13"/>das man uff <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> säche.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z14"/>Haec etsi sunt nullius momenti, tamen hic <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>addere volui, ut videres me velle scribere, <lb xml:id="p3z16"/>si quid haberem.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p3z17"/>Vale, reverende in Christo pater, cum tuis omnibus <lb xml:id="p3z18"/>quam felicissime et diutissime.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8018">Hallero</persName> no<lb xml:id="p3z19"/>n scribo; cupio eum cum tuis omnibus salvere <lb xml:id="p3z20"/>et me excusari ei; nihil erat, quod <lb xml:id="p3z21"/>scriberem.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 21. septembris anno 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p3z22"/>Salutat te d. <persName ref="p3196">Tscharnerus</persName> officiose, sed et cęteri a<lb xml:id="p3z23"/>mici omnes et singuli.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z24"/>Tui observans <persName ref="p8009">Fab[<lb xml:id="p3z25"/>ricius]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>antistiti dignissimo, d. <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>et patri suo in Christo <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>reverendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
